H_{t+1}=H_t+g(M_t).

This does not require claiming that Pantheon magically changes random probability.

Instead:

\boxed{
\text{Recursive Serendipity increases harvest rate more defensibly than raw luck rate.}
}

The world may produce the same number of accidents.

The system becomes better at recognizing which ones matter.

