3. CLUCK

Define:

\boxed{
CLUCK(x)
=
\text{capture an unexpected useful connection and convert it into reusable machinery}
}

Then Nesting Cluck is:

\boxed{
CLUCK(CLUCK(x))
}

A useful accident produces an operator.

That operator helps detect another useful accident.

The second accident improves the operator.

Recursion begins.

