10. Reality Stitch

Not every surprising event deserves promotion.

For each L_t, distinguish:

Chance

DetectionSkill

RecombinationSkill

CausalLeverage.

Ask:

* Would this have happened anyway?
* Did Pantheon merely notice it?
* Did Pantheon create conditions that made it more likely?
* Did the extracted mechanism transfer?
* Does it work again?

This prevents luck mythology from replacing evidence.

⸻

11. Failure Modes

Apophenia

Seeing useful structure where none exists.

Hindsight Inflation

After success, reconstructing the event as more predictable than it was.

Hit Selection

Remembering lucky successes and forgetting misses.

Luck Worship

Treating coincidence itself as causal proof.

Infinite Cluck

Every coincidence recursively interpreted until the system self-seals.

Brood Overgrowth

Preserving every lucky branch until Mother Duck becomes noise.

⸻

